			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Angor Fortress is a Dark Iron stronghold in the northern {link:badlands}Badlands{/link}, a short march from the gates of {link:uldaman}Uldaman{/link}. Long ago its builders forged the Sign of the Earth there, to bind two of {link:deathwing}Deathwing{/link}'s drakes. Now it is the base of the Shadowforge clan. Their warriors, diggers and golems pass from its gates into the vault, and it was from here that they struck Hammertoe's dig. Over them all stands {link:ambassador-infernus}Ambassador Infernus{/link}, sent by {red:ragnaros}Ragnaros{/red} to watch the search for titan relics. {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link} has resolved that the Shadowforge's work in Uldaman can only be slowed by striking at Angor itself.]=],
