			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Lethlor Ravine is a great scar in the eastern {link:badlands}Badlands{/link}, and it belongs to the black dragons. Their whelps and scorched guardians nest along its floor. Beneath it lie the drakes {link:blacklash}Blacklash{/link} and {link:hematus}Hematus{/link}, lieutenants of {link:deathwing}Deathwing{/link}, held in a prison made by the {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link} of {link:angor-fortress}Angor Fortress{/link}. Three runestones keep the seal, each set in a pillar of amethyst, opal or diamond, and only the Sign of the Earth can draw them out. Both the {link:horde}Horde{/link} and the {link:kirin-tor}Kirin Tor{/link} now fear the seal will not hold for ever.]=],
