			text = [=[Prospector Ryedol worked under the explorer Hammertoe Grez at his dig in the northern {link:badlands}Badlands{/link}. When the Shadowforge clan attacked, he was one of the few who escaped. He now keeps a small camp south of the ruined site with {link:sigrun-ironhew}Sigrun Ironhew{/link} and the other survivors. He is plain-spoken and tired, and he says that every day in the Badlands is a bad one.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Ryedol is the thread that ties Hammertoe's fate to {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link}. Through him the kingdom learned that the Shadowforge were not simply raiding. They were hunting for titan secrets, and for the knowledge that Hammertoe carried in his head.]=],
