• He sent a searcher into the vault to find his old master.
• He carried Hammertoe's amulet to {link:historian-karnik}Historian Karnik{/link} in {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link} by another's hand.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Unrecorded",
			text = [=[Nothing is written of Ryedol's life before the {link:badlands}Badlands{/link}.]=],
