				{ type = "quest", id = 719 },
			},
			text = [=[Ryedol lost everything in the attack, even his lucky pick. He believed one of the Shadowforge had taken it. When it came back to him, he was grateful. He was also uneasy. The {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link} had not struck the dig at random, he said. They were looking for something.]=],
		},
