			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 723 },
				{ type = "quest", id = 724 },
			},
			text = [=[Hammertoe was found in {link:uldaman}Uldaman{/link}, but he was dying. He sent back his amulet, the work of his life, and asked that it go to Ryedol. Ryedol said that he had been happier when he thought his master already dead. Then he gathered himself. Hammertoe had worked with {link:historian-karnik}Historian Karnik{/link} of {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link}, and Karnik would know what the amulet meant. Ryedol sent it on to him, so that the death would not be in vain.]=],
