			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Warlord Goretooth commands the {link:kargath}Kargath{/link} Expeditionary Force, the army the {link:horde}Horde{/link} keeps in the {link:badlands}Badlands{/link} to fight the {link:blackrock-clan}Blackrock Clan{/link} and the {link:dark-iron-dwarves}Dark Irons{/link} of {link:blackrock-mountain}Blackrock Mountain{/link}. He is a hard soldier, too busy for visitors and too proud to show fear. He speaks in orders. His wanted notices hang across Kargath, and each one promises a tribute to whoever carries out its sentence.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Goretooth leads the {link:horde}Horde{/link}'s longest campaign in the {link:eastern-kingdoms}Eastern Kingdoms{/link}. His force has suffered badly: the Dark Iron general Angerforge massacred its 109th division. Goretooth has sworn that Angerforge will pay for it.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He commands the K.E.F. from {link:kargath}Kargath{/link}, with his officers {link:lexlort}Lexlort{/link}, {link:galamav-the-marksman}Galamav{/link}, {link:shadowmage-vivian-lagrave}Vivian Lagrave{/link} and {link:hierophant-theodora-mulvadania}Theodora Mulvadania{/link}.
• He posts orders to kill the Anvilrage soldiers of General Angerforge in {red:blackrock-depths}Blackrock Depths{/red}.
• He plans the operation that will bring the Butcher of {link:blackrock-mountain}Blackrock{/link} to justice.
• He orders the deaths of the masters of {red:blackrock-spire}Blackrock Spire{/red}.]=],
